    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18261" root="زنم" body-key="z">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُوَ العَبْدُ زَنْمَةً</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زُنْمَةً</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَنَمَةً</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زُنَمَةً</span></b> 
(S, K) <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَلْمَةً</span> &amp;c., (K,) <i>He is one whose proportion,</i> or <i>conformation, is that of the slave:</i> or,
as Ks says, (or Lh, TA,) the meaning is, <i>truly.</i>
(S.) [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَلْمَة</span>.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَنْمَتَا الفُوقِ</span>: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَنَمَةٌ</span>.

